# URL Shortener API

A simple URL Shortener REST API built with Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and Mongoose.

-Features
-Create short URLs
-Redirect short URLs to the original URL
-Get all stored URLs
-Generate random short URL codes
-Store URL data in MongoDB
-Tech Stack
-Node.js
-Express.js
-MongoDB
-Mongoose
-API Endpoints

## Create Short URL

POST /api/v3/shorts

# Request body:

{
  "url": "https://example.com"
}

-Redirect to Original URL

GET /api/v3/shorts/:id

Example:

GET /api/v3/shorts/a8K2xP

-Redirects to the original URL associated with that code.

Get All URLs

GET /api/v3/shorts/

-Returns all stored URLs from the database.

